From fc2a0bbd7971a97ef43b5644126be74fdaeb32e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mepuka <kokokessy@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:23:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] proof style: the ratchet passes on the typed-context tip; the
 scoped-law generator names its simp sets
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Test.Audit.ProofStyle refused 176 findings at dbb212937: 4 new uses, 2 new unread commands,
170 stale entries. Each one is closed here.

- PrintReadable `inst_of_kinds`: the `.generic` arm's membership is closed by
  `simp only [holeKinds, List.mem_append, List.mem_cons, List.not_mem_nil, or_false, or_true]`
  (the set `simp?` reports), so the declaration is back at its 6 recorded uses.
- ReadLeaf `readKeys_requirementType` was unread because `have norm` cannot parse in the scan's
  environment: `sub_tac` (Laws/Auto/SubsetTac.lean) reserves `norm`. The hypothesis is renamed
  to `hnorm`, so the scan reads the theorem. Making `norm` a non-reserved keyword instead would
  let the `using` term swallow it in `sub_tac using hcompletion norm [...]` (Handles.lean).
- Authoring/Lifts.lean is generated. The three new `simp` uses (`provideContext_scoped`,
  `Action.context_scoped`, `Action.raceAllFirst_scoped`) came from the ScopedLaws template in
  tools/Effect4Gen/Authoring.lean, which closed every lift with a bare `simp [s…]`. The template
  now emits `simp only` with the constructor's scope equation, the argument facts,
  `Bool.and_self` when there are two or more, and `Nat.add_zero` where a data-head row binds
  nothing at a level the equation counts by a `match` on the head (`headCountMatch`). The file
  is regenerated by the command in its header. Its 54 closing sets are the lemma sets `simp?`
  reports, so 51 of the file's simp-without-only entries leave the baseline. The option-cause
  `simp_all` arm stays.
- DenoteR `denoteR_provideContext` is unread for the same reason as its 35 sibling equations:
  `budget` is a `scoped macro` and the scan opens no namespace. DenoteR is not edited (it sits
  low in the graph). The proof (`cases … | succ f => budget hf`) and the macro's expansion
  (a `simp only`) hold no banned use, so the baseline names the gap.
- The baseline is rewritten by `make record-proof-style`: 221 rows leave (the 170 stale
  entries and the 51 cleared Lifts entries), and one row enters
  (`denoteR_provideContext unread 1`). No count rises.

Checks: lake build of the three touched modules; lake build Test.Audit.ProofStyle and
`lake env lean -DwarningAsError=true Test/Audit/ProofStyle.lean` pass; #axiom_audit over
PrintReadable, ReadLeaf and Authoring.Lifts: 1528 declarations within [propext, Quot.sound],
0 planned goals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
